@lam/otel is a Lammergeier third-party library for OpenTelemetry: tracing,
metrics and logs exported as OTLP/HTTP JSON, with W3C Trace Context and
Baggage propagation. It has no third-party dependencies: it is built only on
the Lammergeier standard library and the Go standard library.

It implements the OpenTelemetry specification, the OTLP protocol and the W3C
Trace Context and Baggage recommendations. OpenTelemetry is a project of the
Cloud Native Computing Foundation; no OpenTelemetry source code is included.

@lam/otel 1.0.0 supersedes the `lamotel` 0.2.1 package that was vendored in
the Lammergeier compiler repository under the MIT license.
